`index.html`, `style.css`, `game.js`, `assets/images/.gitkeep`, `assets/sounds/.gitkeep`, `README.md`, `README_fa.md`, `LICENSE`, `Prompt`, `package.json`, `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`.
